# Wrangler's local cache holds the Cloudflare account id it resolved. Nothing
# secret, but it is machine state rather than source.
.wrangler/

# The full Stathead captures fbref/match.mjs reads — hundreds of players'
# worth of table data, most never matched to an FPL player. Keeping that out
# of the repo is the actual compliance posture: what gets committed is
# data/fbref.json, the small derived per-player output, not a bulk copy of
# FBref's own tables. Re-capture by hand (see fbref/match.mjs) to refresh.
fbref/raw/
